  "new-leipzig-school": editorialReview("新莱比锡画派自1990年代发展，以具象绘画将人物、建筑碎片、工业记忆和不连贯叙事并置于舞台式空间，常见错位尺度、冷暖冲突和可见修改。", ["fragmented structural settings, stage-like space, and discontinuous narrative placement", "figurative contours, displaced scale, and deliberate painterly deformation", "gray-green, brown, muted blue-red, and small discordant strong-color accents", "mixed warm-cool illumination with deliberately inconsistent sources", "visible oil layers, erasure, thin scumbling, and selective impasto", "only when text is requested, use restrained contemporary display typography outside the pictorial action"]),
  "hyperrealism": editorialReview("超写实主义自1960年代末在欧美发展，以照片为中介放大反射、皮肤、金属和消费表面的微细节；它比照相写实主义更强调感官过度、尺度放大和近乎不可能的综合色清晰度。", ["extreme close framing, magnified detail, and camera-derived depth cues", "microscopic surface transitions, exact reflections, and sharply resolved volume", "photographic natural color with intensified local saturation and precise neutral balance", "controlled studio or daylight illumination with exact highlights, reflections, and cast shadows", "seamless oil or acrylic layers, airbrush-like transitions, and almost no visible brushwork", "only when text is requested, use neutral legible typography and preserve exact wording"], {zh:["极近距离裁切、细节放大与摄影式景深线索", "微观表面转折、精确反射与高度清晰的综合色体积", "照片式自然综合色配局部增强饱和度和准确中性平衡", "受控影棚光或日光，精确呈现高光、反射与投影", "无缝油彩或丙烯层、喷绘式过渡与几乎不可见笔触", "仅在用户要求文字时使用中性可读字体并准确保留原文"]})
